      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here apparently we want to set the three `superres_*` arrays to some default, placeholder values. But we neglected the `superres_largest_tile_ids` array.\n\nSo the issue is what is the right placeholder value for `superres_largest_tile_ids[this_index]`. In some other places, we set it to 0. So I am setting it to 0 here.",
